~ start
match some_gamestate_value
	when 1
		=> return_to_den_1
	when 2
		=> return_to_den_2
	when 3
		=> asthma_attack
	else
		Error:This dialogue should never play. Heater Number is not 1 2 or 3
=> END

#Create 3 branches for each of the 
#number of heaters turned on
#This includes the long segment about the asthma attack

~ return_to_den_1
Az: Fenn! You did it. Nice job, kid.
Fenn: Thanks! 
Fenn: Can't you help, though? Melt the ice with your fire breath?
Az: No. I thought I told you already. I can't use my fire.
Fenn: But-
Az: No.
Fenn: Az-
Az: I said no!
Fenn: But why?
Az: sigh. I don't like talking about it. 
Fenn: About what?
Az: I have asthma. I can breathe fire, but there's a chance I get an attack. They're not pretty
Fenn: Oohhh...
Az: And my Baba is insane about it. He taught me blacksmithing, and I love it, but it's so rare I can even do it. I swear he freaks out everytime I cough.
Az: I just feel... weak. I hate it.
Az: And sitting here, doing nothing... It drives me crazy! I've been nothing but useless, while you're running around, throwing yourself into danger.
Az: I'm sorry, Fenn. Thank you for your help. It means a lot
Fenn: Yeah. Can I go turn on more heaters?
Az: Haha, yeah we should get a move on.
Winston: Huh... asthma eh?
=> END

~ return_to_den_2
Fenn: Az?
Az: What's up?
Fenn: Is your name Az because you have asthma?
Az: HAH. Haha. No. Boy, the amount of times I've heard that one...
Az: My full name is Zara, but I've been Az since I was a kid. Got my asthma diagnosis much later. Like the world was playing a joke.
Az: How about you, kid? Where's Fenn come from?
Fenn: Oh... I don't really know. Mom said it means "brave"
Az: Hey, I mean. Pretty accurate, far as I'm concerned.
Winston: Ahem... my... my name...
Az: Did you hear something?
Fenn: Wizard man, is that you?
Winston: I- my name's Winston.
Fenn: Oh! Nice to meet you Winston.
Winston: N-nice to meet you too, I guess.
=> END

~ asthma_attack
Winston: Oh Az, why not? It can't be that hard to melt a little ice
Az: Shut up.
Winston: Aww, are you scared? Of me, no less? Not able to enter your own workshop.
Az: Shut. UP.
Winston: Oh, what's this? This looks nice... 
Az: Wh-what are you doing?
Winston: It's a lovely little picture frame. Is that... Abdul?
Az: STOP. Stop this RIGHT NOW. I swear to Post, you do any-
SMASH
Winston: [i]oops[/i]
Az: That's it. I'm coming for you, boy.
Az approaches the door, takes a deep breath
Fenn: Az? What-
Winston: Burn it down, Az!
Az breathes fire over the ice, and it completely melts
She coughs and then collapses
Fenn: Az! No! Are you okay? What did you do??
Az: I- cough I don't cough
Fenn: It's okay. Slow down, I'm here.
Az: I- cough inhaler
Fenn: I- I don't have one. I'm sorry. Just slow, breathe.
Az: cough. G-go
Fenn: What? No!
Az: Go. cough. Winston.
Fenn: Az. Don't be stupid. I'm not leaving.
Az: Go.
Fenn: I'm not leaving, so just shut up about it!
Az: cough
Az: Th- cough thanks.
silence for a few moments
inhaler slides under the door
Fenn: Uh- is- is that?
Az: In- cough inhaler
Fenn grabs it, walks back to Az.
Deep inhale
Fenn: It's okay, breathe.
Deep inhale
Fenn: I'll stay with you until you're good
Fade to black, deep inhale
Az: Ha ha. Fenn, I'm good. You can stop worrying
Fenn: You sure?
Az: Yeah. I'm ready. Let's go get him
=> END